# Pricing for workshops:

**Day Pass** \- $95 - Access to all workshops on the day. **Half Day Pass Morning** \- $55 - Access to all morning workshops except Drum Sing Dance for kids (aged 7 and below). **Half Day Pass Afternoon** - $65 - Access to all afternoon workshops   **Drum Classes Pas**s - $65 - Access to all drumming workshops (including dundun drumming) **Dance Classes Pass** - $55 - Access to all dancing workshops (including dundun dance) **2 Class Pass** - $40 - Access to any two workshops **1 Class Pass** - $25 - Access to one workshop **Drum! Sing! Dance! for Kids** - $10 - Access to Drum Sing Dance Workshop. 

All tickets for the Drum and Dance Launch are [available online](/product/rhythm-culture-drum-dance-launch-2017/). To book for DRUM SING DANCE for kids please [click here](/product/drum-sing-dance-workshops/).
